{"overview":{"Symbol":"FRVO","Name":"Fervo Energy Company","Description":"Fervo Energy Company operates as a geothermal energy developer, builds, owns, and operates geothermal power facilities. The company's product incorporates horizontal drilling, advanced computational models, and distributed fiber optic sensing that increase the productivity and lifetime of geothermal wells. The company employs precision directional drilling technology to drill horizontally in geothermal reservoirs and develops a data analytics algorithm that enables the identification of existing resources and optimizes flow distribution through the reservoir for heat mining efficiency. The company was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqGS","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Utilities","Industry":"Utilities - Renewable","Address":"811 Main Street, Houston, TX, 77002, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"10345112576","EBITDA":"-48516000","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"-19.301","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-0.21","RevenuePerShareTTM":"0.011","ProfitMargin":"0","OperatingMarginTTM":"-353.6667","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-0.03217","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"-0.086210005","RevenueTTM":"138000","GrossProfitTTM":"-250000","DilutedEPSTTM":"-0.21","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"","AnalystTargetPrice":"45.8","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"-162.88545","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"74964.586","PriceToBookRatio":"","EVToRevenue":"","EVToEBITDA":"","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"42.65","52WeekLow":"32.392","50DayMovingAverage":"37.7035","200DayMovingAverage":"37.7035","SharesOutstanding":"286276919","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":""},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"FRVO","3. Last Refreshed":"2026-06-11","4. Output Size":"Compact"},"Time Series (Daily)":{"2026-05-13